= 3.4729 at 1550 nm); SiO2 is constant n = 1.4425. The domain is the device plus 1 µm margins: 34 × 7 × 2.22 µm³ (the paper uses 34 × 7.5 × 4 µm³). TE0 enters o1 (lower left) at 1550 nm with a λ/12 source bandwidth (the paper uses 20 nm). The energy shutoff is 1e-4 (1e-3 for nres ≤ 10; the paper uses 1e-5). We report the cross-port (o3) transmission, the excess loss, the solve time, and the peak memory against resolution.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"jhlTKwRE3I"}],"key":"pRARZ8opc6"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paper values (Tidy3D 2.7.7 on cloud GPUs, Lumerical 2025 R1 on a 24-core CPU; transmission digitized from Fig. 12a):","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"FqHJP7iFUA"}],"key":"ToaG7OoGiq"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"nres","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"lE9wLFKo8v"}],"key":"UMr8B8nG8F"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tidy3D cross T","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"e9w4WhWus3"}],"key":"FxttZvR9hp"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lumerical cross T","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"reLMUTDO89"}],"key":"T6AHRHAeWM"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1